{"id":"lago","lemma":"lago","pos":"noun","rank":1362,"glosses":["lake"],"ipa":"/ˈlaɡo/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"lagos"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/b6/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Rodelar-lago.wav","examples":[{"text":"El lago es grande.","en":"The lake is big.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/636792"},{"text":"Hay 187 888 lagos en Finlandia.","en":"There are 187,888 lakes in Finland."},{"text":"¿El lago es profundo?","en":"Is the lake deep?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/442865"},{"text":"La evaporación de los océanos, lagos y ríos crea el 90% del agua en el aire.","en":"Evaporation from oceans, lakes, and rivers creates 90% of the water in air."},{"text":"Este lago es profundo.","en":"This lake is deep.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/67208"}]}